# Day 4c (build fa3d8edb58): the visualiser, then an episode whose pictures
# stopped about 10 minutes in while the audio played on (a scrub, or
# leaving and coming back, started them again), then Extras.  Gate-sized
# (the 12-minute real-time soak is tests/video/sim_soak.script):
#  start-v0  the visualiser runs a few seconds on the BCM; its close logs
#            the view's summary ("viz soak": frames by who drew them, the
#            holds), the line the 4e bench's visualiser soak reads;
#  v0-h0     the episode plays;
#  h0-h1     the audio's buffer stops short of the video's bytes and never
#            fills (video_fault hole): no push, no post, so the old
#            watchdog (posts counted) never fired and the picture stood
#            for good.  Now the stream falls behind the audio, a still
#            ("video: still: posts, data waits"), the samples from the
#            file, pictures again (one concealed decode error in the
#            simulator's decoder at the stall, around the slow sim audio's
#            jump back: not counted here; the host model shows every
#            packet intact, tests/video/test_vpcore.c 3c6b);
#  h1-f1     one FEED refused, as a full queue (video_fault feed): the
#            packet is never consumed and every later FEED is out of
#            place; the refusal restarts the session where the audio is
#            ("video: FEED refused") and the pictures go on;
#  f1-x0     the play's end line ("video prog end": pictures against
#            the audio's time, the 4e long-play step's line); the video
#            stops and the BCM's jobs come back;
#  x0-       Extras opens (Games: the module pack's index is read on the
#            way in on the device; the simulator's modules are resident).
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-video scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p19-vstall.script
#   python3 scripts/check_trace.py out/shots/ipodui-p19-vstall/sim.log tests/ui/ipodui-p19-vstall.script
# needs: video
# np: viz-full
# reset: viz
# golden: skip
# timeout: 200
# logbetween: start v0 viz soak s=\d+ bcm=[1-9]\d* cpu=0 hold=\d+/\d+ms fb=0
# logbetween: h1 f1 video: FEED refused -?\d+ -?\d+ \(status, want\)
# logbetween: h1 f1 video: FEED refused: \d+ \d+ \(n, in flight\)
# logbetween: h0 h1 video: still: [0-2] \d+ \(posts, data waits\)
# logbetween: h0 h1 video: data still: file -?\d+ -?\d+ \(waits, ms\)
# logbetween: h0 h1 video buf -?\d+ st=
# logbetween: f1 x0 video prog end pics=[1-9]\d\d+ audio_ms=\d+
# logbetween: f1 x0 video prog end still=1 behind=1 data=1 ref=1
# nolog: video: stopped, BCM given back
# nolog: video: image lost
# nolog: CPU FALLBACK
wait 3000
play_files /Music/Tone%20Collective/Sine%20Studies/01%20Concert%20A.mp3
wait 1500
key SELECT          # Music
wait 700
key MENU
wait 700
wheel +10           # "Now Playing"
wait 500
key SELECT
wait 1500
key SELECT          # Scrubber
wait 400
key SELECT          # Rating
wait 600
key SELECT          # Shuffle
wait 600
key SELECT          # Visualizer
wait 4000
key SELECT          # back to Normal: the view closes
wait 1200
ab_mark v0
audio_stop
wait 500
ab_mark h0
video_fault hole 200   # about 3.2 s in (the clip: 742 KB, 12 s)
video_screen /Misc/S01E03.m4v
wait 9000
ab_mark h1
video_fault hole 0
video_fault feed 20
video_wait_refusal 20000   # the refusal itself, not a fixed delay
ab_mark f1
key MENU            # stops, back to the list
wait 2000
ab_mark x0
key MENU
wait 800
key MENU
wait 800
shot mainmenu
wheel -2            # from Shuffle Songs up to Extras
wait 500
key SELECT          # Extras
wait 1200
shot extras
